{"title":"Eggs","slug":"Eggs","pageid":1512,"revid":21257,"timestamp":"2026-04-15T05:55:50Z","lastEditor":"Maxwell Games 3","categories":["Limited"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"history","text":"History"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Eggs</b> (🥚) were a currency during the <span title=\"2023 Easter Event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfRXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023</span>, <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024</span>, <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2026_Easter_Event/\">2026 Easter Event</a> and were used to buy items from the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>. Random <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Scattered_Eggs/\">Scattered Eggs</a> spawns around the map and certain eggs gave more <b>Egg</b> currency than others.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"history\">History</h2>\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2025_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>, this currency could be spent at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Hop_'N'_Shop/\">Hop 'N' Shop</a>;</li>\n<li>In the <span title=\"2024 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyNF9FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2024 Easter event</span>, this currency could be spent at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggcelent_Deals/\">Eggcelent Deals</a>;</li>\n<li>In the <span title=\"2023 Easter event (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvMjAyM19FYXN0ZXJfZXZlbnQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">2023 Easter event</span>, this currency could be spent at the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Eggstatic_Hop_Shop/\">Eggstatic Hop Shop</a>.</li></ul>"}
